1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,800
Why does adding <font color="#00FFFF"><b>more context</b></font>

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,600
to your prompt actually make

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,400
your AI <font color="#FF5252"><b>hallucinate more</b></font>?

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,400
It's called the

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,200
<font color="#00FFFF"><b>Context Distraction Paradox</b></font>.

6
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,100
Most teams think

7
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,800
<font color="#00FFFF"><b>RAG is simple</b></font>:

8
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,600
pull top 10 chunks

9
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,400
and stuff them all in.

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,200
But attention is a

11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
<font color="#FFD700"><b>zero-sum game</b></font>.

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,500
Because <font color="#00FFFF"><b>Softmax</b></font> forces

13
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,600
attention scores across all tokens

14
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,200
to sum to <font color="#FFD700"><b>100%</b></font>,

15
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,400
every irrelevant piece of <font color="#FF5252"><b>noise</b></font>

16
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,000
mathematically <font color="#FF5252"><b>dilutes focus</b></font>

17
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,500
on the verified fact.

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,800
Even worse is

19
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,200
<font color="#FF5252"><b>"Lost in the Middle"</b></font>.

20
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,200
If the critical fact sits

21
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,500
in the center of your prompt,

22
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,800
attention drops by

23
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,500
<font color="#FF5252"><b>over 30%</b></font>!

24
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,800
The model gets distracted

25
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,800
by surrounding noise,

26
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,800
and conflicting text can even

27
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,800
<font color="#FF5252"><b>override</b></font> its own correct

28
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:00,200
internal memory.

29
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:02,200
In production,

30
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,400
never blindly stuff context.

31
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,800
Run a <font color="#00FFFF"><b>Cross-Encoder re-ranker</b></font>,

32
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,200
apply strict score thresholds,

33
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,500
and inject only the top

34
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,800
1 or 2 facts

35
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:16,200
at the <font color="#00FF00"><b>very edges</b></font> of the prompt.

36
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:18,500
Save this architecture for your

37
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,500
next <font color="#00FFFF"><b>RAG pipeline</b></font>,

38
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,800
and <font color="#FFD700"><b>follow along</b></font>!
